se policies haven't worked and it has  created a lot of public anger but  analysts don't expect the policies to  change because the government will  remain much the same and we are  expecting to see the same faces in  cabinet as well now about an hour ago  there was already about there were  already about three nearly 350 000  signatures in an online petition  against um ismail sabri being appointed  as the prime minister  so  you know i'm not sure how much this  changes in terms of um policy um for  malaysia in terms of the pandemic in  terms of how it's going to handle its  economic recovery but what this does is  it does put amna in a much stronger  position than before  florence thank you very much indeed  that's florence louis bringing us up to  date from kuala lumpur
 

